  "body": "Currently, the `save_operator` function in `utils/_operator_utils.py` saves Fermion and QubitOperators using the data serialization module `marshal`. I think it's desirable to save these objects in a human-readable format, like JSON. What do people think? This would probably best be implemented after resolving issue #43.\r\n\r\nAlso, I'm wondering why `marshal` was chosen rather than the more standard `pickle` or `cPickle`.",
